  "open_questions": [
    "What inputs and supported capacities can reach guide-pack u32 index arithmetic, considering host resampling, device buffer/binding limits, guide counts and earlier operations? No output corruption or runtime overflow is claimed.",
    "Does a caller require graph-level preflight for repeated Interpolate before any native work, or is the existing later typed error and batch handling the intended policy? No batch, error, cancellation or side effect was observed.",
    "What finite/range and interpretation constraints apply to Profile.radius, random and relative_to for CPU and GPU consumers? The raw serializable fields do not themselves establish invalidity or product invariants.",
    "The selected shader parameter names line up textually, but native reflection offsets, resource device ownership, actual fast/fallback choice, error propagation and every caller require their own evidence.",
